From f18df64761b67263ee4c054d5d07f492b13dff28 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yann Gautier <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
Date: Wed, 12 Mar 2025 19:27:51 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 860/954] refactor(rse): put MHU code in a dedicated file

To be able to use RSE comms without MHU, a first step is to disentangle
the rse_comms.c file with MHU code direct calls. This is done with the
creation of a new file rse_comms_mhu.c. New APIs are created to
initialize the mailbox, get max message size and send and receive data.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/arm-trusted-firmware.git 0afeb3272ee5ec79da7f2196603f27e99a016bca refactor(rse): put MHU code in a dedicated file]
Signed-off-by: Yann Gautier <yann.gautier@st.com>
